0..76 Comment "// The weakest-precondition observation of state as data: the increment as a"
77..154 Comment "// tree over the row of state alone, and `state-wp.gandr`\'s clauses as a fold"
155..221 Comment "// of the tree into a type, so the normaliser computes a program\'s"
222..295 Comment "// precondition and the kernel replays every declaration here. A Dijkstra"
296..366 Comment "// monad pairs a program with evidence that its transformer is below a"
367..439 Comment "// specification (Maillard et al., \"Dijkstra Monads for All\", ICFP 2019,"
440..510 Comment "// § 2); here the pair is a dependent record: the increment below its"
511..583 Comment "// specification at one postcondition, and the stopped program below the"
584..631 Comment "// return specification at every postcondition."
633..667 Comment "// `Either`, `StateOp` and `Prog`."
